---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import HeroText from '~/components/widgets/HeroText.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Terms and conditions of sale — Santé Natur’',
  robots: { index: false, follow: true },
};

const lastUpdated = 'October 2026';
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <HeroText tagline="Legal" title="Terms and conditions of sale" subtitle={`Last updated: ${lastUpdated}`} />

  <div
    class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pb-16 prose dark:prose-invert prose-headings:font-heading prose-headings:font-bold prose-a:text-primary"
  >
    <h2>1. Seller</h2>
    <p>
      Santé Natur’, a business based in Cotonou, Benin (Fidjrossè Fiyegnon Jacquot, C/1755, Maison Alassane). Contact: <a
        href="mailto:agroalafia@gmail.com">agroalafia@gmail.com</a
      >.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Scope</h2>
    <p>
      These terms and conditions of sale apply to every order placed on the Santé Natur’ online shop. By placing an
      order, you accept these terms without reservation.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Products</h2>
    <p>
      The products offered for sale are natural and wellness products (herbal teas, honeys, natural oils, soaps,
      perfumes, incense, etc.) as well as digital books. Descriptions, compositions and usage advice are provided for
      information only and do not constitute medical advice. If in doubt about using a product, consult a healthcare
      professional.
    </p>
    <p>The products are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease.</p>

    <h2>4. Prices</h2>
    <p>
      Prices are shown in West African CFA francs (XOF), all taxes included. Santé Natur’ reserves the right to change
      its prices at any time. The prices applied are those in force when the order is validated.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Orders</h2>
    <p>
      Every order is firm and final once payment is validated. A confirmation email is sent to the address provided when
      ordering. If there is a problem with your order, contact us within 48 hours of the confirmation.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Payment</h2>
    <p>
      Payment is made online at the time of ordering through the providers FedaPay (bank card, mobile money) or Stripe
      (bank card). Payment on delivery is not available.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Delivery</h2>
    <p>
      Orders are shipped from Benin. Delivery fees depend on the weight of the order and the delivery region; they are
      calculated and shown before payment.
    </p>
    <p>
      Estimated delivery times are communicated to you before payment depending on your destination. These times are
      indicative and may vary depending on transport providers and customs procedures. Santé Natur’ cannot be held
      responsible for delays caused by external factors.
    </p>
    <p>Any customs duties or import taxes are the buyer’s responsibility.</p>

    <h2>8. Digital products</h2>
    <p>
      Digital products (e-books, etc.) are provided through a personal download link sent by email after payment. This
      link is limited in time and in number of downloads. Once downloaded, these products are not refundable, except in
      the case of a technical defect preventing any access to the file.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Right of withdrawal and refunds</h2>
    <p>
      See our <a href="/en/refund-policy">refund policy</a> for detailed conditions.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Liability</h2>
    <p>
      Santé Natur’ undertakes to deliver products matching the published descriptions. Our liability is limited to the
      amount of the order concerned. We cannot be held responsible for indirect damage related to the use of our
      products.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Governing law</h2>
    <p>
      These terms are governed by Beninese law. Any dispute will be submitted to the competent courts of Cotonou, Benin.
    </p>

    <h2>12. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For any question about these terms: <a href="mailto:agroalafia@gmail.com">agroalafia@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
